Package: openmediavault-webtop
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0), openmediavault-compose (>= 8.2.0)
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault Webtop plugin
 Manage the Webtop browser-accessible full Linux desktop (the
 lscr.io/linuxserver/webtop image) from the OpenMediaVault web
 interface. The Docker container is registered in the
 openmediavault-compose plugin, so it follows the Compose plugin
 conventions and can be inspected, edited and started on the Compose
 page; the plugin provides start/stop/restart/update buttons, reports
 the container state and the stack file location and can open the web
 desktop. The container itself is never modified - the desktop and its
 applications are managed from within the Webtop web interface.
 Includes Chinese translations.
